EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}This is a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}single-round {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}game, OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If we're tied, we'll do a tiebreaker 
round! Ready? Here we go!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Jugamos {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}a una sola ronda{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, ¿vale?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si empatamos, ¡sí haremos una
ronda de desempate! ¿List{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}? ¡Ya!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Facciamo solo {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}una mano{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se pareggiamo, allora ne facciamo
un'altra. Pront{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tek ellik {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}bir oyun, tamam mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Berabere kalırsak karar eli oynarız!
Hazır mısın? Başlıyoruz!
